  "description": "Jussie Smollett is a Black American actor, best known for his role as Jamal on the TV show 'Empire'. His identity as a Black man and a liberal (in political alignment) is central to the meme's message. The meme uses his public persona and the assumption of his privilege to make a cynical and harmful claim about systemic justice.",
